# G3 closure, claim by claim (minds PR #17, merged 38b7192)

Obligation (G3, Warrant 3; formerly Warrant 2 duty 9d6ecdaa, whose text said "19"): "Each of the 15 claims unburned before PR #17 is burned by a mutant that fails on its own input, or narrowed to what is held."

At the time of PR #17, 15 claims were unburned. The duty names 19 because it was written before PRs #11 and #12 burned some and PR #15 unburned others. Each row gives the layer a test asks alone, the vector, the mutant(s) and how the other layers are kept out. To reproduce one row: `python tools/run_mutants.py <mutant>` in a checkout of 38b7192, then run `tools/mutant_test.py` on the named test with that mutant applied to see the failure.

